uct covers can have bounded cost must be established directly from the precise Hausdorff-content definition, not inferred from the citation to the dimension threshold. I have not established that this implication is false, so this is an unresolved suspected gap, not a finding that the exercise is false. No new proof route was attempted.\\\",\\\"basis\\\":\\\"The supplied candidate itself lists this lower-bound content/integration argument and its zero-diameter/error treatment as unresolved (proof-draft.json, unresolved_points). I inspected the pinned HausdorffDimension source and obtained checked signatures/evidence for hausdorffMeasure_of_lt_dimH (M001) and LipschitzWith.dimH_image_le (M002); these establish only relevant dimension-theorem interfaces, not the asserted content-level inequality. No complete NL0 v2 spec/graph or structural submission was produced, and no audit PASS is claimed.\\\",\\\"partial_progress\\\":\\\"Frozen target preserved: n is a nonnegative integer, E is nonempty compact in Euclidean R^n, I=[0,1], and E×I has the concatenated Euclidean metric; conclusion dim_H(E×I)=dim_H(E)+1. No added hypotheses or theorem-valued definitions. The supplied upper-cover strategy and the D=0 projection strategy were reviewed; they appear to follow the intended route subject to their ordinary details. Pinned M evidence obtained: hausdorffMeasure_of_lt_dimH, signature as returned by probe_library in Mathlib.Topology.MetricSpace.HausdorffDimension, source Mathlib/Topology/MetricSpace/HausdorffDimension.lean, SHA256 fdc61e7f179044cd714058f209b100e51b6f8af69aff295e3ee629ed45dcee31; and LipschitzWith.dimH_image_le with the same source/hash. No source records were registered in a graph and no artifact was submitted.\\\"}\"}","status":"completed"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[{"type":"function","name":"search_mathlib","description":"在固定 mathlib 的 Lean 源码中搜索正则表达式，返回至多 100 行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"query":{"type":"string"}},"required":["query"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_mathlib","description":"读取固定 mathlib 中一个 Mathlib/...lean 文件的指定行。","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start_line":{"type":"integer"},"line_count":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start_line","line_count"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_task_input","description":"Read an explicitly frozen task document by ID; no other local files are accessible.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["id","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"read_yui","description":"Read declared Yui rules/templates; no tests, historical runs or personal files.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"path":{"type":"string"},"start":{"type":"integer"},"end":{"type":"integer"}},"required":["path","start","end"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"check_artifact","description":"Check a JSON artifact against the explicit stage contract; this is not automatic mathematical certification.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"submit_artifact","description":"Submit a JSON artifact after its stage checks.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"artifact_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["artifact_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"report_obstacle","description":"Stop this stage honestly on a substantive or suspected proof gap, unavailable source, or input conflict. JSON fields: status, location, explanation, basis, partial_progress. Status must be SUBSTANTIVE_GAP, SUSPECTED_GAP, SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE or INPUT_CONFLICT. Difficulty alone is not a mathematical error.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"obstacle_json":{"type":"string"}},"required":["obstacle_json"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false},{"type":"function","name":"probe_library","description":"Query a proved Mathlib theorem and its exact signature/axioms in the offline sandbox. Returns located evidence for an M source; the mathematical statement and applicability still require review.","parameters":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string"},"declaration":{"type":"string"},"module":{"type":"string"}},"required":["id","declaration","module"],"additionalProperties":false},"output_schema":null,"strict":false}],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":false,"prompt_cache_key":"b8b1c060-a8a8-4014-bdf0-f4b97be45dcf","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"text"},"verbosity":"low"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"effort":"high","context":"all_turns","summary":null,"mode":"standard"},"user":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":27367,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0},"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":173},"total_tokens":28097,"attribution":{"items":{"fc_0c21933eebe074e0016adb1d500a6c8191a0de820d9648421d":{"input_tokens":31,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c21933eebe074e0016adb1d527478819194c07e18ffdf4a16":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c21933eebe074e0016adb1d543ec08191b8514d8e25e2b4e7":{"input_tokens":34,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c21933eebe074e0016adb1d570b108191aa8249608e491ca2":{"input_tokens":33,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"fc_0c21933eebe074e0016adb1d5975388191bd0e6be33dc83734":{"input_tokens":35,"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_token